Z||000010||RossT||03-31-2001||11:01 AM||||That 79 dollars is per pair.<P>The Darker wires are + and the lighter wires<BR>are -<P>It also helps to buy the Crutchfield gm speaker wire adapter for 5 dollars a set, thus you do not need to splice anything.||||reg||1
